<script type="rocketlazyloadscript">
document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function () {
    const minSlider = document.getElementById('brochure-min-budget-slider');
    const maxSlider = document.getElementById('brochure-max-budget-slider');
    const minDisplay = document.getElementById('brochure-min-budget-value');
    const maxDisplay = document.getElementById('brochure-max-budget-value');
    const range = document.getElementById('brochure-slider-range');
    const hiddenInput = document.getElementById('brochure-budget-range-value');

    if (!minSlider || !maxSlider) return;

    function formatBudgetValue(value) {
        const intValue = Math.round(value);
        if (intValue >= 10000000) {
            const crores = intValue / 10000000;
            return crores % 1 === 0 ? `${crores.toFixed(0)} Crores` : `${crores.toFixed(1)} Crores`;
        } else if (intValue >= 100000) {
            const lakhs = intValue / 100000;
            return lakhs % 1 === 0 ? `${lakhs.toFixed(0)} Lacs` : `${lakhs.toFixed(1)} Lacs`;
        }
        return intValue.toLocaleString('en-IN');
    }

    function updateBrochureSlider() {
        const minVal = parseInt(minSlider.value);
        const maxVal = parseInt(maxSlider.value);
        const min = parseInt(minSlider.min);
        const max = parseInt(minSlider.max);
        const minPercent = ((minVal - min) / (max - min)) * 100;
        const maxPercent = ((maxVal - min) / (max - min)) * 100;
        range.style.left = minPercent + '%';
        range.style.width = (maxPercent - minPercent) + '%';
        minDisplay.textContent = formatBudgetValue(minVal);
        maxDisplay.textContent = formatBudgetValue(maxVal);
        hiddenInput.value = `${formatBudgetValue(minVal)} to ${formatBudgetValue(maxVal)}`;
    }

    minSlider.addEventListener('input', function () {
        if (parseInt(minSlider.value) > parseInt(maxSlider.value)) maxSlider.value = minSlider.value;
        updateBrochureSlider();
    });
    maxSlider.addEventListener('input', function () {
        if (parseInt(maxSlider.value) < parseInt(minSlider.value)) minSlider.value = maxSlider.value;
        updateBrochureSlider();
    });

    updateBrochureSlider();
});
</script>

        <section class="sectionPadding mb-4 lg:mb-[2vw]">
            <div  class="container m-auto accordion-data lg:!ml-[6rem]">
                <div  class="mb-5">
                    <h2 class="mainHeading pb-4 xl:pb-[1vw]">FAQ’s</h2>
                </div>
                <div  class="m-auto  accordion-data faq">
                                    <div class="border-t  border-gold px-4 lg:px-[1vw]" data-aos="fade-up">
                    <div class="flex justify-between items-center cursor-pointer accordion-header1   ">
                        <h3 class=" py-4 xl:py-[1vw] ">What is the relationship between Runwal Realty and the erstwhile Runwal Group?</h3>
                       <span class="accordion-icon text-[2rem] text-gold  ">+</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="accordion-content1 hidden mt-2 xl:mt-[0.3] pb-4 lg:pb-[2vw] ">
                      <p>From 2016 onwards, the erstwhile Runwal Group has operated as two independent entities — Runwal Realty, led by Mr. Sandeep Runwal and Runwal Enterprises, led by Mr. Subodh Runwal — each with its own distinct leadership, identity, and strategic direction.</p>
<p>Founded by Mr. Subhash Runwal in 1978, the Runwal name has been built on a legacy of trust, quality, design excellence, and a deeply customer-first philosophy. Today, that legacy continues independently through both companies.</p>
<p>Runwal Realty under the leadership of Managing Director, Mr. Sandeep Runwal, is one of India’s leading luxury and lifestyle real estate developers, with over 35 delivered projects across key locations in the MMR and Pune regions. Beyond residential developments, the company has built a diversified platform spanning retail, commercial, and hospitality, including landmark assets such as R City Mall in Ghatkopar and R Square in Andheri. Its upcoming hospitality portfolio across Worli, Thane, Pune, and Alibaug further strengthens its mixed-use development expertise.</p>                    </div>
                </div>
                            <div class="border-t  border-gold px-4 lg:px-[1vw]" data-aos="fade-up">
                    <div class="flex justify-between items-center cursor-pointer accordion-header1   ">
                        <h3 class=" py-4 xl:py-[1vw] ">What configurations are available at Runwal The Central Park in PCMC?</h3>
                       <span class="accordion-icon text-[2rem] text-gold  ">+</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="accordion-content1 hidden mt-2 xl:mt-[0.3] pb-4 lg:pb-[2vw] ">
                      <p>Runwal The Central Park offers three configurations: 2 BHK (671-747 sq.ft), 3 BHK (978-1199 sq.ft), and 4 BHK (1935 sq.ft) homes, catering to diverse family needs in PCMC. To know more about the carpet area and prices, contact <a href="https://runwalrealty.com/our-project/residential-ongoing/runwal-the-central-park/">Runwal The Central Park</a>.</p>                    </div>
                </div>
                            <div class="border-t  border-gold px-4 lg:px-[1vw]" data-aos="fade-up">
                    <div class="flex justify-between items-center cursor-pointer accordion-header1   ">
                        <h3 class=" py-4 xl:py-[1vw] ">What is the carpet area range of homes at Runwal The Central Park?</h3>
