                    </div>
                    <div class="accordion-content1 hidden mt-2 xl:mt-[0.3] pb-4 lg:pb-[2vw] ">
                      <p>Runwal The Central Park stands apart from other ongoing residential projects in Pune as the city's largest 26-acre integrated mixed-use development in PCMC. With 40-storey towers, 50+ lifestyle amenities including a 50,000 sq. ft. clubhouse, the largest in PCMC, and a design that seamlessly blends international living standards with open green spaces, it sets a benchmark that few projects in Pune can match.</p>                    </div>
