                    </div>
                    <div class="accordion-content1 hidden mt-2 xl:mt-[0.3] pb-4 lg:pb-[2vw] ">
                      <p>Among ongoing projects in Pune, Runwal The Central Park is in a league of its own — as the city's largest 26-acre integrated mixed-use development in Chinchwad with 40-storey towers, 50+ lifestyle amenities, and seamless connectivity to the Old Mumbai-Pune Highway (0.1 km), Metro Station (0.6 km), and Chinchwad Railway Station (1.5 km).</p>                    </div>
                </div>
