                      <p>Buyers should consider Runwal The Central Park's strategic location in Chinchwad with Metro Station access (0.6 km) and proximity to the Old Mumbai-Pune Highway (0.1 km), the diverse configurations ranging from 2 to 4 BHK, the 26-acre scale of the development, 50+ lifestyle amenities, and its RERA-registered status making it one of the most well-rounded <b>ongoing residential projects in Pune</b> to invest in today.</p>                    </div>
