<div data-wpr-lazyrender="1" class="footer-content border-t border-gold">
    <div class="container">
        <div  class="row">
            <div class="col footer-about" style="padding-top:30px; padding-bottom:30px;">
                <h2 style="font-size:clamp(20px,1.6vw,28px); font-weight:600; margin-bottom:15px; color:#0C5E52;">
                    About Runwal The Central Park in Pimpri-Chinchwad, Pune
                </h2>
                <p>
                    Set on the old Mumbai-Pune Highway in Pimpri-Chinchwad, Runwal The Central Park is one of the most talked-about luxury projects in Pune. Spread across 26 acres, the development weaves together residential towers, a large-format mall and expansive open landscapes into a single integrated township. Conceived as PCMC&rsquo;s tallest development with 14 towers, Runwal The Central Park gives residents a home that feels complete in itself.
                </p>
                <div class="read-toggle-wrap" style="text-align:left; margin-top:15px;">
                    <a href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="toggleFooterReadMore()" id="footerReadMoreBtn" class="read-toggle" style="text-decoration:none; color:#0C5E52; font-size:14px; font-weight:500; display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; cursor:pointer;">
                        Read More <span style="font-size:16px; line-height:1;">&#x2193;</span>
                    </a>
                </div>
                <div id="footerMoreContent" style="display:none; animation: fadeIn 0.4s ease;">
                    <h3 style="font-size:clamp(16px,1.15vw,20px); font-weight:600; margin-top:20px; margin-bottom:10px;">
                        Location on the Old Mumbai-Pune Highway
                    </h3>
                    <p>
                        Runwal The Central Park sits on the old Mumbai-Pune Highway, minutes from an upcoming metro station at Finolex Chowk on the Pimpri-Swargate corridor. The neighbourhood already places residents close to established hospitals, malls, banks and schools, while flyovers and high-speed road networks keep the rest of Pune and Mumbai within easy reach. For anyone comparing residential projects in Pimpri Chinchwad, this level of connectivity, by rail, road and an upcoming metro all converging nearby is what sets the address apart.
                    </p>
                    <h3 style="font-size:clamp(16px,1.15vw,20px); font-weight:600; margin-top:20px; margin-bottom:10px;">
                        2, 3 &amp; 4 Bedroom Homes and What&rsquo;s Inside Them
                    </h3>
                    <p>
                        Runwal The Central Park offers a coveted range of <a href="https://runwalrealty.com/2-bhk-in-pune/" style="color:#0C5E52; text-decoration:underline;">2, 3 and 4 BHK layouts</a>, including homes that facilitate Jodi units for larger families, making it one of the more flexible luxury apartments in Pune currently on offer. Every unit is planned for 10-foot floor-to-ceiling heights, maximised cross-ventilation, Vaastu-compliant layouts and optimised sunlight. For buyers specifically comparing 4 BHK luxury flats in Pune, the layouts here are built to avoid wasted space while keeping every room naturally lit and ventilated.
                    </p>
                    <h3 style="font-size:clamp(16px,1.15vw,20px); font-weight:600; margin-top:20px; margin-bottom:10px;">
                        Amenities Beyond the Home
                    </h3>
                    <p>
                        Runwal The Central Park has over 50 amenities spread across landscaped and podium-level space, anchored by one of PCMC&rsquo;s largest clubhouses at 50,000 sq. ft. Residents get everything from a bonfire deck, barbecue deck and alfresco dining to a yoga and meditation deck, reflexology path, tree houses and a dedicated kids&rsquo; play zone. The development also houses the largest indoor pool in PCMC. For those searching for the best <a href="https://runwalrealty.com/3-bhk-apartment-in-pune/" style="color:#0C5E52; text-decoration:underline;">apartments in Pune</a> on the basis of lifestyle offerings, this project is worth considering.
                    </p>
                    <h3 style="font-size:clamp(16px,1.15vw,20px); font-weight:600; margin-top:20px; margin-bottom:10px;">
                        RERA Details
                    </h3>
                    <p>
                        The project is registered with MahaRERA under registration numbers P52100025260, P52100030291, and P52100032101. If you&rsquo;re comparing Runwal The Central Park with other new projects in PCMC, please verify current unit sizes, pricing, and possession timelines directly with <a href="https://runwalrealty.com/contact-us/" style="color:#0C5E52; text-decoration:underline;">Runwal Realty&rsquo;s sales team</a>, and confirm the RERA registration details on the MahaRERA website before booking.
                    </p>
                    <div class="read-toggle-wrap" style="text-align:left; margin-top:25px;">
                        <a href="javascript:void(0)" onclick="toggleFooterReadMore()" class="read-toggle" style="text-decoration:none; color:#0C5E52; font-size:14px; font-weight:500; display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; cursor:pointer;">
                            Read Less <span style="font-size:16px; line-height:1;">&#x2191;</span>
                        </a>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
